  "artDirection": "Same selected warm-tan child scientist with thoughtful amber eyes, fine brown clear round glasses, white bob/cat-ear headband, red scarf, white lab coat, dark clothes/boots/teal pouch. Soft dimensional game illustration. Scene1 rear chalkboard-writing professor, white headband ear backs, cat anatomy = liquid beaker and liquid??. Scene2 flask mixing, cream cat hanging supported from bookshelf, orange window-squeeze cat, pale-blue/green cats resting inside foreground glass containers; corrected small paws and coherent folded legs. Scene3 sudden explosion and diagonal feet-first suction into dark floor vortex, cream ledge cat has modest foreleg and thin tapered tail. Scene4 bewildered forest arrival, green/orange/blue cats rest DIRECTLY ON GROUND, no laboratory containers. Scene5 gently held gravity-long green cat and orange/blue ground-resting cats; no glass cylinder/jar/tub anywhere. Scene6 green floor aperture reveals human cat playroom with cat tower/toys. Scenes7/8 color-portal guidance/farewell. Cats have rounded bodies, two forelegs from shoulders/two hindlegs from pelvis/one tapering tail, modest head-relative paw size; no inflated bear feet or tail resembling extra limb. Relaxed lazy eyes, no nasal sleep bubbles. Portals always horizontal.",
